OL,3,ATanker hit by multiple projectiles in
OL,4,AGulf off Qatar, maritime agency says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tanker has been struck by "multiple
OL,7,Fprojectiles" north of Qatar in the
OL,8,FGulf, according to the United Kingdom
OL,9,FMaritime Trade Operations agency.
OL,11,FThe incident - a rare attack deep
OL,12,Finside the Gulf - happened 51 nautical
OL,13,Fmiles (94km) from Madinat al-Shamal
OL,14,Fwith casualties reported, the UKMTO
OL,15,Fsaid.
