OL,3,ATanker hit by multiple projectiles in
OL,4,AGulf off Qatar, maritime agency says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaritime intelligence firm Vanguard
OL,7,Fidentified the vessel as the Antigua
OL,8,Fand Barbuda-flagged oil and chemical
OL,9,Ftanker Acers. On Saturday it was
OL,10,Freported as sailing towards the Strait
OL,11,Fof Hormuz waterway, which connects the
OL,12,FGulf to the Gulf of Oman.
OL,14,FMerchant vessels have come under
OL,15,Frepeated attack in the region since the
OL,16,FUS and Israel's war with Iran began in
OL,17,FFebruary.
